dustry\\\" and is based in the UK.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"[1]\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"* A report by the International Sports Journalists Association (AIPS) lists SportsPro as one of the top sports business publications in the world, with its headquarters in London, UK.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"[2]\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"* The magazine's editorial team includes experienced journalists and industry experts from the UK, further solidifying its connection to the country.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"[3]\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"* SportsPro has been recognized for its contributions to the sports industry, including winning the \\\"Best Sports Business Publication\\\" award at the 2019 Sports Business Awards, held in London.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"[4]\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"**References**\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"[1] SportsPro.\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, {\"id\": \"s18\", \"text\": \"About Us.\"}, {\"id\": \"s19\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.sportspromedia.com\\\\/about-us\\\\/>\"}, {\"id\": \"s20\", \"text\": \"[2] International Sports Journalists Association (AIPS).\"}, {\"id\": \"s21\", \"text\": \"(2019).\"}, {\"id\": \"s22\", \"text\": \"Top Sports Business Publications.\"}, {\"id\": \"s23\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.aipsmedia.com\\\\/top-sports-business-publications\\\\/>\"}, {\"id\": \"s24\", \"text\": \"[3] SportsPro.\"}, {\"id\": \"s25\", \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, {\"id\": \"s26\", \"text\": \"Editorial Team.\"}, {\"id\": \"s27\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.sportspromedia.com\\\\/editorial-team\\\\/>\"}, {\"id\": \"s28\", \"text\": \"[4] Sports Business Awards.\"}, {\"id\": \"s29\", \"text\": \"(2019).\"}, {\"id\": \"s30\", \"text\": \"Winners 2019.\"}, {\"id\": \"s31\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.sportsbusinessawards.com\\\\/winners-2019\\\\/>\"}, {\"id\": \"s32\", \"text\": \"T